{"seq":4,"slug":"serverless-patterns","title":"GitOps 与声明式基础设施","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/devops-sre/cloud-native-basics/serverless-patterns","wordCount":1383,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"gitops-与声明式基础设施\">GitOps 与声明式基础设施</h1><h2 id=\"什么是-gitops\">什么是 GitOps</h2><p>GitOps 是一种以 Git 仓库作为唯一事实来源（Single Source of Truth）的运维模式。它将基础设施和应用的期望状态以声明式配置文件的形式存储在 Git 中，通过自动化工具持续将集群的实际状态与 Git 中的期望状态保持同步。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[开发者] --&gt;|Push 代码| B[应用仓库]&#10;    B --&gt;|CI 构建镜像| C[镜像仓库]&#10;    C --&gt;|更新镜像标签| D[配置仓库 GitOps Repo]&#10;    A --&gt;|Push 配置变更| D&#10;    D --&gt;|自动同步| E[GitOps 控制器&lt;br/&gt;ArgoCD / Flux]&#10;    E --&gt;|Apply| F[Kubernetes 集群]&#10;    E --&gt;|检测漂移| D\">graph LR\n    A[开发者] --&gt;|Push 代码| B[应用仓库]\n    B --&gt;|CI 构建镜像| C[镜像仓库]\n    C --&gt;|更新镜像标签| D[配置仓库 GitOps Repo]\n    A --&gt;|Push 配置变更| D\n    D --&gt;|自动同步| E[GitOps 控制器&lt;br/&gt;ArgoCD / Flux]\n    E --&gt;|Apply| F[Kubernetes 集群]\n    E --&gt;|检测漂移| D</pre><h3 id=\"gitops-四原则\">GitOps 四原则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>实践</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>声明式</td>\n<td>系统的期望状态以声明式方式描述</td>\n<td>YAML/HCL 配置文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本化</td>\n<td>所有变更通过 Git 管理</td>\n<td>Pull Request 审批流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动化</td>\n<td>变更被批准后自动应用</td>\n<td>GitOps 控制器持续同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自愈</td>\n<td>系统自动纠正偏离期望状态的漂移</td>\n<td>控制器定期对比并修复差异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"gitops-vs-传统-ci-cd\">GitOps vs 传统 CI/CD</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统 Push 模式</th>\n<th>GitOps Pull 模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>部署触发</td>\n<td>CI 流水线 Push 到集群</td>\n<td>集群内控制器 Pull 变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限模型</td>\n<td>CI 系统需要集群写权限</td>\n<td>只有集群内控制器有写权限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态管理</td>\n<td>依赖 CI 的执行记录</td>\n<td>Git 历史即部署历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漂移检测</td>\n<td>通常不检测</td>\n<td>持续检测并自动修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回滚方式</td>\n<td>重新执行旧版本流水线</td>\n<td>Git revert 即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审计追踪</td>\n<td>CI 日志</td>\n<td>Git commit 历史</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>GitOps 是一种以 Git 仓库作为唯一事实来源的运维模式，通过自动化工具持续将集群的实际状态同步到 Git 中声明的期望状态。理解它需要先厘清一组基本概念。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>在本主题中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>声明式</td>\n<td>描述期望状态而非执行步骤</td>\n<td>GitOps 的配置形态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>唯一事实来源</td>\n<td>Git 仓库是系统状态与变更历史的权威来源</td>\n<td>一切变更的起点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pull 模式</td>\n<td>集群内控制器主动拉取 Git 变更并应用</td>\n<td>区别于 CI Push 模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漂移 Drift</td>\n<td>集群实际状态偏离 Git 中声明的期望状态</td>\n<td>控制器持续检测并修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自愈</td>\n<td>系统自动纠正偏离期望状态的漂移</td>\n<td>GitOps 控制器内置能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ArgoCD / Flux</td>\n<td>主流的 GitOps 控制器</td>\n<td>执行同步与漂移检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kustomize</td>\n<td>基于 base/overlay 的声明式配置管理</td>\n<td>多环境配置复用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>GitOps 的核心价值是把变更流程统一到 Git 这个已被充分治理的载体上：权限模型、审计追踪、回滚方式都复用 Git 的历史与 PR 流程，集群侧只需一个持续同步的控制器。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"argocd\">ArgoCD</h2><h3 id=\"argocd-架构\">ArgoCD 架构</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Git 仓库] --&gt;|监听变更| B[ArgoCD Server]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Application Controller]&#10;    C --&gt;|对比期望 vs 实际| D{状态同步?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[Synced 健康]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[OutOfSync]&#10;    F --&gt;|自动/手动同步| G[Apply to K8s]&#10;    G --&gt; E&#10;    B --&gt; H[Web UI / CLI]&#10;    B --&gt; I[API Server]\">graph TD\n    A[Git 仓库] --&gt;|监听变更| B[ArgoCD Server]\n    B --&gt; C[Application Controller]\n    C --&gt;|对比期望 vs 实际| D{状态同步?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[Synced 健康]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[OutOfSync]\n    F --&gt;|自动/手动同步| G[Apply to K8s]\n    G --&gt; E\n    B --&gt; H[Web UI / CLI]\n    B --&gt; I[API Server]</pre><h3 id=\"application-定义\">Application 定义</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1&#10;kind: Application&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: web-app&#10;  namespace: argocd&#10;spec:&#10;  project: default&#10;  source:&#10;    repoURL: https://github.com/org/gitops-repo.git&#10;    targetRevision: main&#10;    path: apps/web-app/production&#10;  destination:&#10;    server: https://kubernetes.default.svc&#10;    namespace: production&#10;  syncPolicy:&#10;    automated:&#10;      prune: true&#10;      selfHeal: true&#10;      allowEmpty: false&#10;    syncOptions:&#10;      - CreateNamespace=true&#10;    retry:&#10;      limit: 5&#10;      backoff:&#10;        duration: 5s&#10;        factor: 2&#10;        maxDuration: 3m\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">argoproj.io/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Application</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">argocd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  project</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">default</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    repoURL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://github.com/org/gitops-repo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    targetRevision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/web-app/production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  destination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    server</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://kubernetes.default.svc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  syncPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    automated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      prune</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      selfHeal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      allowEmpty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    syncOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CreateNamespace=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    retry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      backoff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        factor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        maxDuration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3m</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"同步策略\">同步策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>手动同步</td>\n<td>需要人工点击同步</td>\n<td>生产环境谨慎部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动同步</td>\n<td>Git 变更后自动同步</td>\n<td>开发/测试环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动修剪（Prune）</td>\n<td>删除 Git 中不存在的资源</td>\n<td>保持集群干净</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自愈（Self-Heal）</td>\n<td>手动修改集群后自动恢复</td>\n<td>防止配置漂移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# ArgoCD CLI 常用命令&#10;argocd app list&#10;argocd app get web-app&#10;argocd app sync web-app&#10;argocd app rollback web-app 1&#10;argocd app diff web-app&#10;argocd app history web-app\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ArgoCD CLI 常用命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">argocd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">argocd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">argocd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sync</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">argocd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollback</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web-app</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">argocd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">argocd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> history</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web-app</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"flux\">Flux</h2><h3 id=\"flux-架构\">Flux 架构</h3><p>Flux 是 CNCF 孵化项目，采用更加 Kubernetes 原生的设计：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Git 仓库] --&gt;|Source Controller| B[GitRepository CR]&#10;    C[Helm 仓库] --&gt;|Source Controller| D[HelmRepository CR]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Kustomize Controller]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Helm Controller]&#10;    E --&gt;|Apply| G[Kubernetes 集群]&#10;    F --&gt;|Apply| G&#10;    H[Notification Controller] --&gt;|通知| I[Slack/Teams]&#10;    G --&gt;|Image Automation| J[Image Reflector]&#10;    J --&gt;|更新镜像标签| A\">graph TD\n    A[Git 仓库] --&gt;|Source Controller| B[GitRepository CR]\n    C[Helm 仓库] --&gt;|Source Controller| D[HelmRepository CR]\n    B --&gt; E[Kustomize Controller]\n    D --&gt; F[Helm Controller]\n    E --&gt;|Apply| G[Kubernetes 集群]\n    F --&gt;|Apply| G\n    H[Notification Controller] --&gt;|通知| I[Slack/Teams]\n    G --&gt;|Image Automation| J[Image Reflector]\n    J --&gt;|更新镜像标签| A</pre><h3 id=\"flux-kustomization\">Flux Kustomization</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: kustomize.toolkit.fluxcd.io/v1&#10;kind: Kustomization&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: web-app&#10;  namespace: flux-system&#10;spec:&#10;  interval: 5m&#10;  path: ./apps/web-app/production&#10;  prune: true&#10;  sourceRef:&#10;    kind: GitRepository&#10;    name: gitops-repo&#10;  healthChecks:&#10;    - apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;      kind: Deployment&#10;      name: web-app&#10;      namespace: production&#10;  timeout: 3m\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kustomize.toolkit.fluxcd.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Kustomization</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">flux-system</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./apps/web-app/production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  prune</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  sourceRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GitRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">gitops-repo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  healthChecks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3m</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"argocd-vs-flux\">ArgoCD vs Flux</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>ArgoCD</th>\n<th>Flux</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>UI 界面</td>\n<td>内置 Web UI</td>\n<td>无内置 UI（可用 Weave GitOps）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>架构风格</td>\n<td>独立的应用服务器</td>\n<td>K8s 原生 CRD + Controller</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多集群管理</td>\n<td>内置支持</td>\n<td>通过 CRD 配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RBAC</td>\n<td>内置细粒度 RBAC</td>\n<td>使用 K8s 原生 RBAC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Helm 支持</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>通过 Helm Controller</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kustomize 支持</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>镜像自动更新</td>\n<td>需要第三方工具</td>\n<td>内置 Image Automation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通知集成</td>\n<td>内置 Notification</td>\n<td>Notification Controller</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等偏高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[选择 GitOps 工具] --&gt; B{需要 Web UI?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[ArgoCD]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{偏好 K8s 原生方式?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[Flux]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| C\">flowchart TD\n    A[选择 GitOps 工具] --&gt; B{需要 Web UI?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[ArgoCD]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{偏好 K8s 原生方式?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[Flux]\n    D --&gt;|否| C</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"gitops-仓库结构\">GitOps 仓库结构</h2><h3 id=\"单体仓库-vs-多仓库\">单体仓库 vs 多仓库</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单体仓库</td>\n<td>统一管理、简单</td>\n<td>权限粒度粗</td>\n<td>小团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用仓库 + 配置仓库</td>\n<td>