-shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'512Mi'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1000m'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1Gi'</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"gitops-安全实践\">GitOps 安全实践</h2><h3 id=\"secret-管理\">Secret 管理</h3><p>Git 仓库中不能存储明文 Secret。常用的解决方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Sealed Secrets</td>\n<td>加密后存入 Git，集群内解密</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>简单场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SOPS + Age/PGP</td>\n<td>使用外部密钥加密文件</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>多环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>External Secrets Operator</td>\n<td>从外部密钥管理服务同步</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>AWS/GCP/Azure</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vault</td>\n<td>HashiCorp Vault 集中管理</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>企业级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# External Secrets Operator 示例&#10;apiVersion: external-secrets.io/v1beta1&#10;kind: ExternalSecret&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: app-secrets&#10;spec:&#10;  refreshInterval: 1h&#10;  secretStoreRef:&#10;    name: aws-secrets-manager&#10;    kind: ClusterSecretStore&#10;  target:&#10;    name: app-secrets&#10;    creationPolicy: Owner&#10;  data:&#10;    - secretKey: DATABASE_URL&#10;      remoteRef:&#10;        key: production/app/database-url&#10;    - secretKey: API_KEY&#10;      remoteRef:&#10;        key: production/app/api-key\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># External Secrets Operator 示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">external-secrets.io/v1beta1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ExternalSecret</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app-secrets</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  refreshInterval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  secretStoreRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">aws-secrets-manager</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterSecretStore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app-secrets</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    creationPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Owner</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">secretKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DATABASE_URL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      remoteRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production/app/database-url</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">secretKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">API_KEY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      remoteRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production/app/api-key</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见陷阱\">常见陷阱</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>避免方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Git 仓库过大</td>\n<td>大量 YAML 文件导致仓库膨胀</td>\n<td>使用 Helm Chart 或 Kustomize 减少重复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secret 泄露</td>\n<td>明文 Secret 被提交到 Git</td>\n<td>使用 Sealed Secrets 或 External Secrets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环同步</td>\n<td>控制器修改导致 Git 与集群反复不同步</td>\n<td>配置忽略规则（ignoreDifferences）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境差异管理混乱</td>\n<td>多环境配置散乱</td>\n<td>使用 Kustomize overlay 统一管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回滚不完整</td>\n<td>Git revert 后依赖的基础设施未回滚</td>\n<td>将所有依赖纳入 GitOps 管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>GitOps 通过将 Git 作为唯一事实来源，实现了声明式、版本化、自动化和自愈的基础设施管理。ArgoCD 提供了直观的 Web UI 和完善的多集群支持，Flux 则更贴近 Kubernetes 原生设计。选择合适的仓库结构、配置管理工具（Kustomize/Helm）和 Secret 管理方案，是成功实施 GitOps 的关键。GitOps 的核心价值在于：每一次变更都是一个可审计的 Git commit，每一次回滚都是一个简单的 Git revert。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GitOps 与声明式基础设施","id":"gitops-与声明式基础设施"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是 GitOps","id":"什么是-gitops"},{"level":3,"text":"GitOps 四原则","id":"gitops-四原则"},{"level":3,"text":"GitOps vs 传统 CI/CD","id":"gitops-vs-传统-ci-cd"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ArgoCD","id":"argocd"},{"level":3,"text":"ArgoCD 架构","id":"argocd-架构"},{"level":3,"text":"Application 定义","id":"application-定义"},{"level":3,"text":"同步策略","id":"同步策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Flux","id":"flux"},{"level":3,"text":"Flux 架构","id":"flux-架构"},{"level":3,"text":"Flux Kustomization","id":"flux-kustomization"},{"level":3,"text":"ArgoCD vs Flux","id":"argocd-vs-flux"},{"level":2,"text":"GitOps 仓库结构","id":"gitops-仓库结构"},{"level":3,"text":"单体仓库 vs 多仓库","id":"单体仓库-vs-多仓库"},{"level":3,"text":"推荐的仓库结构","id":"推荐的仓库结构"},{"level":3,"text":"环境晋升流程","id":"环境晋升流程"},{"level":2,"text":"Kustomize 实践","id":"kustomize-实践"},{"level":2,"text":"GitOps 安全实践","id":"gitops-安全实践"},{"level":3,"text":"Secret 管理","id":"secret-管理"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱","id":"常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"服务网格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/devops-sre/cloud-native-basics/service-mesh"},"next":{"title":"定义 SLI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/devops-sre/sli-slo-sla/defining-slis"}}